### 🟡 Priority 6 — APNs Relay Ignores Non-200 Status Codes

**File:** `CaraokeCore/Sources/Network/APNsRelayService.swift`  
**Line:** ~110  

```swift
guard httpResponse.statusCode == 200 else {
    return  // ❌ silent failure
}
```

**Bug:** APNs can return `403` (invalid provider token), `410` (device token unregistered), `429` (rate limited). All are currently ignored, so push delivery fails silently.  
**Fix:** Handle each status code explicitly with retry/backoff and token invalidation.

